## Symptom

Single-root c2c relay connect --once runs bare Lwt_main.run (sync t) with no SIGALRM and no run_sync_once (c2c_relay_connector.ml:3733-3751) - against a hanging relay it blocks forever (scripts and CI hang). The machine --once path does use run_sync_once.

## Fix direction

Route single-root --once through run_sync_once too.

